apture.tsx` to handle file drop and uploading the food item for analysis by Gemini.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will modify the scripts in `package.json` to configure our full-stack architecture running over tsx in development and compiling to a bundled CommonJS module via esbuild for production."
