r maximum speed and performance, directly addressing nested `undefined` values. The implementation will be explicit and robust. The `sanitizeDbData` helper function will be added to `src/lib`.\n\n\n**Implementing Data Sanitization**\n\nI\'m now going to add the `sanitizeDbData` helper to `src/lib`. I\'ll apply this on the `profile` and `log` arguments in `saveUserProfile` and `addFoodLog` within `firebase.ts`. I just reviewed the function implementations again to make sure I am comfortable with where to add this logic.\n\n\n"
