    summary: "To manually toggle dark mode in Tailwind CSS, you configure Tailwind to use a class-based strategy and then use JavaScript to add or remove a designated class (commonly `dark`) from your HTML.\n\nHere\'s a breakdown of the process:\n\n1.  **Configure Tailwind CSS for Class-Based Dark Mode**:\n    In your `tailwind.config.js` file, set `darkMode` to `\'class\'`. This tells Tailwind to apply dark mode styles whenever the `dark` class is present on an ancestor element, typically the `<html>` tag[1][2][3].\n    \n\nSources:\n[1] [cruip.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFfcWb3sxp3-tl1ADMo9mYVvKff9A0qocRRlKkft-dYXsSp1oVqq5yiqYjJBMLjZN14T59-VE1WL6oqa3-N9ju0rHP15wIKVp-9RHOSCoP5rNv-1ZcyC1EsQ6ktlw82cNv3oh6Op2r6Vk_IgS9719EIMyutwoKhvyKibQVSowJMkUSAUif-h_Oq)\n[2] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFsqQvD2tIz_bMvsgpx6yOmpPtY7VBibLm9wllgdLcnWPkayQb_5x2eLCmjYcdFLNsTo0P8sjRQCuWS5L_H5KZh-Z8_3Auzeb6MCINJBiaZtIjJa7P98U0GOL1sTQUoaC-iwAl7oH1ynYnaKVybzRm6xltIIA==)\n[3] [tryhoverify.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHZFLCd-G-euUgBq2pHR1bZnT5Fh_lggxf5y_KQUW2l5-1Ze_DhFB4_nE_KPrFMNoIBQk0SevW2JooXxl6PwNLvgEG-RgU7dMvXZloLieZuxj-cIMDr8_zL_Jcsl7cW4aKcAm_SQKmXiwJRS_Yf5pFO6an1qNt37AtdmZhkLPmMBNQ0lIvwsnwitJCXTzOJ)\n[4] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG6ByqRpnmTA4PXz8OfgyT8ogWgtlVxzQTzC0xXc5fzP07_A-shkwtSCbM8Z2ZcUSI_i9Qss11FE35SFj6hZ3quS9h6GbZ_1IOOtw34weB0lYTzHPxuTHJ2rpI2fWJC2mzf)\n[5] [stevekinney.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFJQGTVdotAgKqmDV_DTrcVb_8F-9vljO1gcOQH3C5ycIO39-DxdazJhhnMp5EBZDuRR9ulN1VTJGnh31jh9bcXxHi6qQ45gxCuGhpsOUioTICekCrCqgv_iddmhT6EcsrU9BV4lLHUfGHKYJy9)\n[6] [djamware.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH804bjVu64EPBdNctX5I9zQ5Wi2DqYMvs_LJbFZ_I_944xNrO1BtVN9zGIPguT8-KCApU2PIRKxWrS5GqZI_R7ttOURmZ7WK_nqKcMd4QPbKKOVSWMcmhSVKwnw3QMdWSwb3wPXxAhqE-OnUYefeN1G_SRo6RzaaWKq_4KDxAwwgEfDyxXMnXgF_T-)\n[7] [preline.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHlZkBt9nSyJUXtVArGM2s4KqxuZ44vdFzJicHNndZyKVoMb_IYg4O79rbOv6EQer5KB4k_2fyCIxa9UwL5bhqqL2oH_6lU54b_NjHENtFUrl02kZx7doYnVT0rHXUvLGnc)\n[8] [flowbite.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYZNJ_cDfPc-t8Ly5E0xictrQo1Cu7qYPDD6kmBPVKYvRiQTOXfv2-ffVZ7uX4Pg9M20HGQLkHPAaC9in-PU-Tf4p4W5b6iu0m6la1s9MA6cOGAHP5nxxJnoEMJa-qk5I4JpeajGYMVV8=)\n[9] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfhcO8v5WSdmPmrf00nGk142DriGSEiYn7wTh8ufkUyCdM6t8LF59IgrsYcL0Qo5mQkt9sPa5DrcLuuPxQcGEEnnrDGTrU57K79Fj_qPuHb4eJuxgahTztk_hM4x0lnvIj_ttALSg=)\n[10] [thingsaboutweb.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGaie8NZjhi0uwfEdOssHmbR_b1YoGYfoVJcTT3ttqxJ_plxdlSCNnjmS89sR9nIJNV-UKLmjACKWA5eYL6rMoaSHdCSEcW8EfyRnNUrfmzdxB0yrECADrfkyNbcAXCcv0f-kFUExdaK6_9ecHupjDSGe1K1XinFj8WExYh3GGptFlAAHY=)\n[11] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFe282mLbUNG-dAjyVwowDh5veiDoA_s7Ti-aJjZMgbU6h5Nf0alB--QLMRvM6pn6dbmscY0x0_Z0eM-cp6VCc0jh-tH30sphHSF2QQDCoZ8tw1TjYd8RQXKccoWCA32zlCR8VEkJn_giYS5a5RW9uN7XlF)\n[12] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFofgYUaI10sz3lHHVaEDVqpxjlF-HQIF_OFlukPlHLrjPqWI0VJry4dVbWfXWeZLOZD4CO6u7Zj97Z33DC8_ghZdfrVqRyej1nSpyreYoWjJO7LV_HSaIPlQ9MoL-UH7Q6G8VCZVk=)"
