    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHxEq1ZqT9gkdlYMaUavPdzKe160p4RZf81dxtMKYjgxO2cVmO7oyle77Ad1zVLo9ju3twHoT1RcOWbypl1zLkvdmc-Nd4MGQJTwWTUxJuUlUTUPb2xxNfbZq-QU0RhSrV7GGI_"
      title: "tailwindcss.com"
    }
    summary: "In Tailwind CSS v4, the `@variant dark` directive is used in conjunction with a class selector to implement dark mode, often following a \"CSS-first\" approach[1]. This allows you to define how dark mode is activated within your stylesheet.\n\nThe most common method for enabling dark mode with a class selector involves defining a custom variant that looks for a specific class, such as `.dark`, on a parent element (e.g., the `html` or `body` tag)[2][3][4][5][6].\n\nHere\'s how it generally works:\n*   **Defining the Custom Dark Variant**: In your main CSS file (e.g., `global.css` or `index.css`), you use the `@custom-variant` (or `@variant`) directive to create a `dark` variant. This directive specifies the CSS selector that triggers the dark mode styles[2][3][7][8][4][5]. A common syntax for this is:\n    \n\nSources:\n[1] [kitemetric.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGi4D8W1SKHXIUWDZYcAS8mYONvmt9E8TcZOSp5Q4VHv6cHzEgYpWezzU0i9DYgcIl6xiaEzDIuv5rHwSN9CiPvek1rIw6gdxGkcUY54utpBEccUDEf_qAhp1GNpNlo52-J7OL5dZL-BG1AXn1KahpWc7KP0Ajl95aMmaGuYM7sqvn94-7_s6qm8xjsag_BSC-UmoHBrZE=)\n[2] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFOl7pWr6gm4beFfrUvy8cx4YGsOh6xG7iVoSEfKwooaFT_C4yN0cmQB0mU0EyS1BbY5reUURJRjFdT9XcwGma_tLDxeBJB-3JVPGCZcRQUg-g6u7LeL1p4TW7m67dArowSBaT68HDHSmJWi_I_yW7XNLA=)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH5TSeZiqZ0v7yueec2puJhUIQcYeAxOmTLLan4-MDD7jFweLGW_mRKH3Uw1SQLmuPYvDoT9B3yP8Me8cF7nfMScxF1J1encCYXZ1TUIEqdrj8WSM8cGGJCs9V1Vgdk-TOgKjikcw==)\n[4] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHw_jF5fYF_oI2PfWOpic3GgYDRdlklbS4T2xEYiYZ5Ui1DDWiP06kkVK3DHyVDsJAcrid_m8oWYnSKZtcwCfiss151Je6mgb6uatmj2WpGVMNVl2itMeLq4yHAPTIknJ8xVbWh4A==)\n[5] [kitemetric.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFxdJV3SckKa6iicxljNNiMSJozaDNSU2nzulGYZuYmh3ISw4QsEEX0KwX70MQmBOVhVqVtRvqLayjlVRv3uoKSc-6Klq8WtqTDYQnuQ3BxS53hwp-2--bhhQqX14MSO1rb_lwx2VWhZQn9EA1BpnDI2t3wFgYMCSNYyPJAqRnrVsIkfOl3fY9UPlj0wQoMIN3OBCc=)\n[6] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHyxfCdkOSWWviojfN9xiBnKpV0Xt8OJuLMRvqlT0o-95WTn403Y87qpWy9xxsM290u9wo3QSKKKzV3yp-U2PIbJU0j4kSaXiZWRc9MOgjKYPh7pN6AyOGJUDaLw7iqliU=)\n[7] [reddit.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG_mCIC2tbnJAzEJC7jb9zNZQtLrhF61zpADp5ewsUCdeEaSUgL2T2bN0Whqk28_gi9cFr2mYF512fBxCKjlJSwfSdHZlBzZASAhheCrPMNgnikuUUTj7XZ6sFKxmInBel1MK_HbKqxKy8FuXgM0DMwQlv7YYbwgWjzFLrsCCQxNzN6Jp__xrDdBASetrYtFmGoDo078qON61Oozag=)\n[8] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGXhN1X7BTSn4wKEzLS0NKNSBjedKh8pj8y7-Sq5lU9i1wvG_B23Yj7TMU400Hzs6LTaWRurrKAtokIaYbr6e7oj3vIgWZBBB0nMik7CgLTHEjc-G5pWPr5u4pPwVPWOBKAE_0J_obFayLwzIIHSVaLXZKXNdJAvg==)\n[9] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEfMsxOi0hxctMe5n4A6qs4V40SvfYRtP8-_ubPeInkX-nXM3e3UZ_kwl-2G0UHLaw0h-XbIsbOIQNhHPh1OxIS_YuHNU7KHK_0yTDlHQLtpn9DQtHEUHDmiXQMDHsUDEblB5LsK8dTGIQXzQuakULL3qmF8sg6qkF7c6hZ8mGRkuNfoY7WSlzoHUu77287dHqAml0X5cVqz_bGLqd7_5AfxBU3UbtY-Xy5ppp-XnMufw==)\n[10] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHlK6TDTPZSPnPKxusSPdcXmntVzJIMdMsfSX9CZpxFrFjOSQEGHZjqS2We1KDrFiNFxAz6gJKlTSlhHveMIzuugbJcSy5A8Og3ATTYkfA0VlQNj-rmEspMN6uhHdMhcW0ztC7U1g==)\n[11] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHpKnzbPxvF_kN_gaAa3OsxFz0SvLB0BZoXERSH8itW5atzh_mUu292rP8OhTk5A2rq9MUnQhgZ4KB-2E5UE6FcGYwgcwdRj753iIkH5xc5hGSbOgB_mRSTSCUieQDyveJ-VXyZBT1LxSvicMeB5SxsR0AZ5UGH3QTsZGcmAwNIDpZMoNBZev9-aQzDdmcvr1cBtI8CYUInOfeEUKyd-DQjuxco3nEb)\n[12] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEIv7rOjdZOagPxHNtNC38OlDzn4bf9AwaH4Xb_DIC3NlZv1mk4ZcdbXf7TwYBg1uEGG1hEdsV5uzKn30Kx7MFdKZ0OSYraxhJGrI_FAuC_vewxoBViDwyifIwrllXtzMD5Y9o