          text: "### Getting started\n- [Installation](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/installation)\n- [Editor setup](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/editor-setup)\n- [Compatibility](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/compatibility)\n- [Upgrade guide](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/upgrade-guide)\n[Installation](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/installation)\n[Editor setup](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/editor-setup)\n[Compatibility](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/compatibility)\n[Upgrade guide](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/upgrade-guide)\n\n### Core concepts\n- [Styling with utility classes](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/styling-with-utility-classes)\n- [Hover, focus, and other states](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/hover-focus-and-other-states)\n- [Responsive design](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/responsive-design)\n- [Dark mode](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/dark-mode)\n- [Theme variables](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/theme)\n- [Colors](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/colors)\n- [Adding custom styles](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/adding-custom-styles)\n- [Detecting classes in source files](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/detecting-classes-in-source-files)\n- [Functions and directives](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/functions-and-directives)\n[Styling with utility classes](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/styling-with-utility-classes)\n[Hover, focus, and other states](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/hover-focus-and-other-states)\n[Responsive design](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/responsive-design)\n[Dark mode](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/dark-mode)\n[Theme variables](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/theme)\n[Colors](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/colors)\n[Adding custom styles](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/adding-custom-styles)\n[Detecting classes in source files](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/detecting-classes-in-source-files)\n[Functions and directives](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/functions-and-directives)\n\n### Base styles\n- [Preflight](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/preflight)\n[Preflight](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/preflight)"
