          }
          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_3
            text: "Resources"
          }
          text: "### On this page\n- [Overview](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#overview)\n- [Toggling dark mode manually](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#toggling-dark-mode-manually)[Using a data attribute](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#using-a-data-attribute)[With system theme support](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#with-system-theme-support)\n- [Using a data attribute](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#using-a-data-attribute)\n- [With system theme support](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#with-system-theme-support)\n[Overview](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#overview)\n[Toggling dark mode manually](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEUqJ0VHvMtVPxP431W-6U_Psr-_b-JPDl-TWIz-HEz9YMhYstd1hcbKiM5gFtdR31gbj4pEXxT48BRbBtVhFdhXEkm3CeYhGsmBtYzzCLuh8kXDyzlOd5fTFyjfIbBlk5I#toggling-dark-m