      title: "youtube.com"
    }
    summary: "In Tailwind CSS v4, custom variants and the `@variant dark` selector are defined directly within your CSS using the `@custom-variant` directive. This approach replaces the JavaScript-based plugin system of previous versions, aligning with v4\'s CSS-first configuration.[1][2][3]\n\nHere are examples of how to define and use these selectors:\n\n**1. Custom Variant Example using `@custom-variant`**\n\nTo create a custom variant, such as `custom-variant`, you define it in your CSS file (e.g., `index.css` or `global.css`). The directive takes the variant name and a selector modifier.\n\n*   **CSS Definition (Nesting Syntax):**\n    \n\nSources:\n[1] [kitemetric.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGJKhHtQj0wnw-jmXaPKwHOgpaymcWWuTOrT_8dzmj2shYIku53BNfTtBnU_SQLpBLwq2BretJkx0yKc8Brr8CWQMijoophKve4qhUmZ5YAbtFq-JbMVeXjZcJifTubfDe-1gMRiLt3WQB0NoVcZGc5nhhVLDz9LgToxON3_gkeTcZ-o7fY6EKhhKlwfbUefjq02EfXi_4O)\n[2] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF-xJbSCXvX1q6qk_wEKTYpj8kaxvRJ7Vqqdp2cU6mZqFC8FF0WU3_pNdXTPEd3Z6NGywuRNavKHwAirjbOcd4hRnjCdjgjprW5cC2UPReGObIAYzNBwzoOWN1FXNSWVXqdQo8RCBs=)\n[3] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHein9hSsNCvQ24yka3TOwY8XPpXU5c5Y-fWP1KuRjXSPzXptkhlDe5LsWy6hS5YUfzvNcc-EBmy_Ivd7VthXk0BIjFSYksAfUk-L2cUp8wMvtChjqCpqJX_VWrC6OZnRgbDXPe3uGaaeZ2Ryr97650zGmAOcjkUGXBgohh7OqSUz39cP7Yrxxtyr1hG2EHZQvn392ZlWpge8B9SfNquN-C4E82hBXavBPeJA==)\n[4] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHqiphuw6OW7DVf7dKeJJ-xxgeDRI73wXnq_mRJCAtYxn99NTk3r_Awdji7dULYTKy-dwDn2vzb3uXFgI5OkRy-SIU9tSvXT6f8ux-3X0e82nzh0EzQ-ddQ5VEAm9L5xiNi1MsVzKMUpeCLvu1_fPI0JrVTnV5WFtQQV42xKl6zgSoEIQnXW9DGaioa_TWvck6fiPG1RQNYgFf6kQ==)\n[5] [tailkits.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEMtKWNwbhLFtdvb2Ci-NtTFaZovpomIjDyLLTtRQgVjd1wP9l1IGmD8Ed3paDGIQHh-y3ymQNYPWfhbXyBldtAlVE70GdlkbrJB4dOX_FbUO9pkaMR7lO82HLGcLzobMPV8jXU1vaxIt30rmuTPGdxRZ60)\n[6] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEqwX_FfxcpZ5zIrYkgwOGJOOq-y8itXb1eZfzmbAer8VyUmknsT4uUhKozlzd60bISi9Qv30NspRuDrTOOVYJw_YWliS7O7JqEwTmmJox5zw6PJP8pXRdv9Z83ZGvj1gmL)\n[7] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEMMC2cEfJXZf7bOV2KrZsxPHjMAxoDBwcRkyC9IXV0oUTVVpywub9aNGKOvJz8UAiapFdgPAWnDPhOooqucdYEOE6xjCrI0dbI-f6mecwf65ccf8hnWjRO544wRKGgrJRzoVvFeXcyPmA04ryuRA4_aIId)\n[8] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQECLvz5XGlUcetst9lPt5S_AGOdjYgdubNjt84rISTWXX5ow81E79cqgvMHpQlTmrPHtxtLkaROwC8qVMDTLt7-Y-eZv30gPiSqOwEs1P7rcE-esndQ6Mu3fX9M9j5UrhOW24HKDtE=)"
