          text: "### [Tailwind Plus](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus?ref=footer)\n[Tailwind Plus](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus?ref=footer)\n- [UI Blocks](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/ui-blocks?ref=footer)\n- [Templates](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/templates?ref=footer)\n- [UI Kit](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/ui-kit?ref=footer)\n[UI Blocks](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/ui-blocks?ref=footer)\n[Templates](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/templates?ref=footer)\n[UI Kit](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/ui-kit?ref=footer)\n\n### Community\n- [GitHub](https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss)\n- [Discord](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/partners#insiders)\n- [X](https://x.com/tailwindcss)\n[GitHub](https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss)\n[Discord](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/partners#insiders)\n[X](https://x.com/tailwindcss)\n\n### Tailwind CSS\n- [Documentation](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs)\n- [Playground](https://play.tailwindcss.com/)\n- [Blog](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/blog)\n- [Showcase](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/showcase)\n- [Sponsor](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/partners)\n[Documentation](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs)\n[Playground](https://play.tailwindcss.com/)\n[Blog](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/blog)\n[Showcase](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/showcase)\n[Sponsor](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/partners)\n\n### [Tailwind Plus](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus?ref=footer)\n[Tailwind Plus](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus?ref=footer)\n- [UI Blocks](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/ui-blocks?ref=footer)\n- [Templates](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/templates?ref=footer)\n- [UI Kit](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/plus/ui-kit?ref=footer)\n[UI Blocks](https://vertex