          }
          text: "### Interactivity\n- [accent-color](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/accent-color)\n- [appearance](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/appearance)\n- [caret-color](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/caret-color)\n- [color-scheme](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/color-scheme)\n- [cursor](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/cursor)\n- [field-sizing](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/field-sizing)\n- [pointer-events](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/pointer-events)\n- [resize](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/resize)\n- [scroll-behavior](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-behavior)\n- [scrollbar-color](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scrollbar-color)\n- [scrollbar-width](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scrollbar-width)\n- [scrollbar-gutter](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scrollbar-gutter)\n- [scroll-margin](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-margin)\n- [scroll-padding](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-padding)\n- [scroll-snap-align](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-snap-align)\n- [scroll-snap-stop](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-snap-stop)\n- [scroll-snap-type](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-snap-type)\n- [touch-action](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/touch-action)\n- [user-select](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/user-select)\n- [will-change](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/will-change)\n[accent-color](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/accent-color)\n[appearance](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/appearance)\n[caret-color](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/caret-color)\n[color-scheme](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/color-scheme)\n[cursor](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/cursor)\n[field-sizing](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/field-sizing)\n[pointer-events](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/pointer-events)\n[resize](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/resize)\n[scroll-behavior](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-behavior)\n[scrollbar-color](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scrollbar-color)\n[scrollbar-width](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scrollbar-width)\n[scrollbar-gutter](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scrollbar-gutter)\n[scroll-margin](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-margin)\n[scroll-padding](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-padding)\n[scroll-snap-align](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-snap-align)\n[scroll-snap-stop](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-snap-stop)\n[scroll-snap-type](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/scroll-snap-type)\n[touch-action](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/touch-action)\n[user-select](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/user-select)\n[will-change](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/will-change)\n\n### SVG\n- [fill](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/fill)\n- [stroke](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/stroke)\n- [stroke-width](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/stroke-width)\n[fill](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/fill)\n[stroke](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/stroke)\n[stroke-width](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/stroke-width)\n\n### Accessibility\n- [forced-color-adjust](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/forced-color-adjust)\n[forced-color-adjust](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs/forced-color-adjust)\nCore concepts"
