          headers {
            type: MARKDOWN_NODE_TYPE_HEADER_3
            text: "Resources"
          }
          text: "### On this page\n- [Overview](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#overview)\n- [Toggling dark mode manually](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#toggling-dark-mode-manually)[Using a data attribute](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#using-a-data-attribute)[With system theme support](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#with-system-theme-support)\n- [Using a data attribute](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#using-a-data-attribute)\n- [With system theme support](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#with-system-theme-support)\n[Overview](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#overview)\n[Toggling dark mode manually](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#toggling-dark-mode-manually)\n- [Using a data attribute](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#using-a-data-attribute)\n- [With system theme support](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#with-system-theme-support)\n[Using a data attribute](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#using-a-data-attribute)\n[With system theme support](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEtnzd8ANM9_vGrjo_zTO1Srvh87SAmu3ZZpwZyMSNQUTJsKPJwpMAp6sUHU7SPmLs1rn7oQ3cKeb9z38p8L_yyRDM7Lyo8Ps-_-A1kz7f9ruxUOpNORnOHwxZT3URa_n0Y#with-system-theme-support)\n\n### Tailwind CSS\n- [Documentation](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs)\n- [Playground](https://play.tailwindcss.com/)\n- [Blog](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/blog)\n- [Showcase](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/showcase)\n- [Sponsor](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/partners)\n[Documentation](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/docs)\n[Playground](https://play.tailwindcss.com/)\n[Blog](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/blog)\n[Showcase](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/showcase)\n[Sponsor](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/partners)\n\n### Resources\n- [Refactoring UI](https://www.refactoringui.com)\n- [Headless UI](https://headlessui.com)\n- [Heroicons](https://heroicons.com)\n- [Hero Patterns](https://heropatterns.com)\n[Refactoring UI](https://www.refactoringui.com)\n[Headless UI](https://headlessui.com)\n[Heroicons](https://heroicons.com)\n[Hero Patterns](https://heropatterns.com)"
