      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFzU3ZYWRzkUh8CQf3mypcYi167iZ7gjISoNV89vrzVaVuLQ4XDG82-4SHaCc151JmDvE8e_krOQInN5cMlE2eY1dBNLF2eCZ28o639EyUBcX39xrJxXKje7vZ9VfNmPDVw9d76yFOCTSY01IjkqEKiEquiiHTrEdMBqA999BsQAiXOUN-qxu22oeVwNLoFD9sbMpUORrcT0A=="
      title: "stackoverflow.com"
    }
    summary: "In Tailwind CSS v4, the `@variant dark` directive is used within your main CSS file to define how dark mode styles are applied, moving away from JavaScript-based configuration in `tailwind.config.js` from previous versions.[1][2][3][4]\n\nThe `(&` syntax is part of the CSS selector used within the `@variant dark` rule to specify the conditions for activating dark mode. Common examples include:\n\n*   **Class-based dark mode**: This approach applies dark styles when a specific class (e.g., `.dark`) is present on an ancestor element (often `<html>` or `<body>`). You would typically see syntax like `@variant dark (&:is(.dark *));` or `@variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));`[5][6][7][4][8][9]. This tells Tailwind to apply the dark variant styles if an element or any of its parents has the `.dark` class.\n*   **Data attribute-based dark mode**: This method uses a `data-theme=\"dark\"` attribute on an ancestor element to trigger dark styles. The syntax would be similar: `@variant dark (&:where([data-theme=\"dark\"], [data-theme=\"dark\"] *));`[1][6].\n\nTailwind CSS v4 also supports defining dark mode based on the user\'s system preferences using media queries, such as `@variant dark (@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark));`[2]. The framework leverages modern CSS nesting syntax to generate dark mode utilities.[1]\n\nThe introduction of `@variant` (and `@custom-variant` for creating your own variants) is a key part of Tailwind CSS v4\'s \"CSS-first\" configuration, enhancing performance and simplifying theme management directly within your stylesheets.[2][10][11][4]\n\nSources:\n[1] [thingsaboutweb.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFdIQDgJNtI6cebnh43OJAW4XnYKR8j3x1iKhijhSdDnNO7oOBhzBkIFVkt8xhlRFMcj4OlDMdUUOcT6-apOc6frKLdDsOHsPmLN5Mdzh_FgRid7Aiu8zn0hOWZowbxAHWUwZVD56jGm8vEB80qVuAu56BL0SXoABWjErMd-DKWemZxeio=)\n[2] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEoesLEPHPYs072zgagjPTEXyd_OO7ieeC0VwjygLYYIvtG2mqcGSuhYT3Qk45RtgQcZcsqNEm5GT4-O0tL5Gt0IUhkYHk_WSzwO-wlJpAO8CjMkYZFzN8zd2s4wbM-8NhHgoI4XNnNy9OHtcgFML0Wf65fQiclNiUYEHbn8vncftoHU9cuGKaWBPvyeiHQEfBN1IXsCsc6IGwiwpJegm1KaYF6Lc1f-u9HfQ==)\n[3] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHkh07o8IZ0c3v2SJyPpZsfVS3JLN0I8H2wrxAXH55Kd-QS6mv6QLB4bJOKycihgJdL77k0AghiTVHl-2pZb_89xBnNloamuDK33kyQrWvxbXTElgUCgMh6y6ubqju4PRUhN2A0x6Mz5T0hLvT6rodnK8wx0V9FEzpqGzLyMALW9yzmqFrvrKzHVuq6lMHzwbZw4DyVMzyvoNCyg2JCbOUtkfTYaQ==)\n[4] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEq1KoMoGiVVOTWtdQedmYiQSivEPEuWxva1oEYU8f-CyMjxiVz5oZkhBNYi3H_mnN_iSZB40TNzo5yXEU9SWbxxqmadDwRSrnSA_xjgpUQCQGukxRQXxrV8AuftrbEmSDL8ilUm7vKw8HDdN-buzP_ObzfWZGQKc3ZE-sZE7cYpvvviq8QDFdETC00lCDuJIu-94gUe7XA-sP8)\n[5] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH_iUDgc1gE2fitfSGYrGjDmmOmsVZ5gbFk5HJgF4SGgxfgE9CPzb9BZjZhsFA08iqxR0QhCdb7doC-n7TmO4brX6tv3G6MWZuUFx9uqAsQuNYj0b_GXwrVrifszShqbMsrxP6HRduFXWiurlSeMcNuEm7AGySFCSvzwNKwpqFK7mJOsw==)\n[6] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEoyaDimKu6tkcH9d0QkGbE7tmWlXRnuhU_525MR5iBlwiGxwl-aaOGM03LDvnxQ6sQAFMkRjJPRXHkf8t7bV9IE9w4-peLB9vb6OvMG4hRCmuOLtfuZcXKGgw_EYLm83S2bE0x-gIAUU5KKk0BtkvTvw0FHQteYos=)\n[7] [designrevision.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE6CvKCFzhiwZ17ZPGup4_yUCGgyNNxgvUSLb8kuWYjlPXfm81FpGStz1jtVS4dXG2ruyWEXZXbrW32XMYKt3TAQ4mpYSgSlXs8lD1SrUAESIER3vZqJlfkd_UO1aemajjZuqIc_G5Lcd8mnVJInbM=)\n[8] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF5iShKaKjU-Z4r72WVJOACRHRPlaAsuQL_EaIHaCn5bM8-EnCuAQpTCcHqfTr0YAgPH9DW9l5fjsxvmjVPWkw50q6NSrSgSDPdraFGCWWSiWPUFOb6UVRRRG8KXdRvpRZkYtNGZhs6PKPZcosnjJWR5gCq)\n[9] [digitalapplied.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHUDQeEyP9P7_cAu6z53rNnkFcAKycc3Kehwb-SgLZyMwgObxhcI0LzCgqnem-9puDwjINvZ75CWdtr-_wts_ojZslk7Ld