          }
          text: "- [Open-sourcing our progress on Tailwind CSS v4.0](https://tailwindcss.com/blog/tailwindcss-v4-alpha)\n- [Tailwind CSS v4.0 Beta 1](https://tailwindcss.com/blog/tailwindcss-v4-beta)\n- [Tailwind v4.0 Beta Document](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/v4-beta)\n[Open-sourcing our progress on Tailwind CSS v4.0](https://tailwindcss.com/blog/tailwindcss-v4-alpha)\n[Tailwind CSS v4.0 Beta 1](https://tailwindcss.com/blog/tailwindcss-v4-beta)\n[Tailwind v4.0 Beta Document](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/v4-beta)\n- [rss](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/rss)\n[rss](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/rss)\nrss\n\302\251 2024-present Things About Web Dev. All rights reserved.\n[Buy me a tea](https://www.buymeacoffee.com/finfin)"
        }
