      summary: "Dark mode support has become a fundamental aspect of modern web applications, and I recently tackled this feature for my personal blog using Tailwind CSS v4 beta with Next.js 15. In this article, I\'ll walk through my journey of implementing a dynamic theme toggle, share my learnings of both frameworks.\'\n"
    }
    resolved_url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFdIQDgJNtI6cebnh43OJAW4XnYKR8j3x1iKhijhSdDnNO7oOBhzBkIFVkt8xhlRFMcj4OlDMdUUOcT6-apOc6frKLdDsOHsPmLN5Mdzh_FgRid7Aiu8zn0hOWZowbxAHWUwZVD56jGm8vEB80qVuAu56BL0SXoABWjErMd-DKWemZxeio="
    latency_ms: 1230
  }
