      title: "bryananthonio.com"
    }
    summary: "Tailwind CSS v4.0 introduces significant changes to how dark mode and custom variants are configured, moving much of the logic directly into CSS. The syntax `@variant dark` or `@custom-variant dark` is used to define the behavior for dark mode styling[1][2][3][4][5][6][7][8].\n\nKey aspects of dark mode implementation in Tailwind CSS v4.0 include:\n*   **CSS-First Configuration** Instead of relying heavily on a JavaScript configuration file (`tailwind.config.js`) as in previous versions, Tailwind v4.0 moves configuration options, including dark mode variants, directly into the main CSS file using `@theme` and `@variant` directives[1][3][4][9][8][10].\n*   **Defining Dark Variants** The `@variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` or `@variant dark (&:where([data-theme=\"dark\"], [data-theme=\"dark\"] *));` syntax is used in CSS to specify that dark mode styles should be applied when a parent element (like `<html>` or `<body>`) has the class `.dark` or a `data-theme=\"dark\"` attribute[1][2][4][6][11][7][12][13]. This allows for manual toggling of dark mode[2][13].\n*   **Default Dark Mode Behavior** By default, Tailwind CSS v4.0 uses the `prefers-color-scheme` media query to automatically detect a user\'s system theme preference (light or dark)[1][2][4][9][13]. However, developers can override this default to implement class-based dark mode for manual toggling[2][4][9][13].\n*   **CSS Variables for Theming** Tailwind v4.0 extensively uses CSS variables (custom properties) for colors and other design tokens, making theming more flexible and performant. These variables can be defined at the root level of your CSS, allowing for easy customization and manipulation of themes, including dark mode[1][3][4][14][12][9][15].\n*   **Migration from v3** For users migrating from Tailwind CSS v3, dark mode configuration is a significant change. In v3, `darkMode` was configured in `tailwind.config.js`, whereas in v4, it\'s handled via CSS[1][4][9][8]. An upgrade tool is available to help with this migration[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [thingsaboutweb.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7CdKvtI42jG4WIXCzQBL5UJQAm9Se7y2a-boNpu2NJtEwvV0Ebpx3j9wGga_g07gF-zyFFq1KwUGRmvfR1LVTygmC6LAVRYqr0OCML5wZlerviUvbJmG-rcNbMM8EubyPtltq7IKXn1lsutVm_CaYbdHO2rJA_CANyvmVtLNmIkBMUiU=)\n[2] [tailadmin.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH7STjHcPWF1gxOSDMc9Csk4n7RupfQY6EEdbvXNX9E2Og1I1HcZYKemUkpN77sToIIJnu3eyVy5i8YME5x2Z_-DAD8S6Ncj57s4jMpbP7gv5wM19WwM-yJTbFNsZ1e-m6HW30YAofkg9CCp-gqcQ==)\n[3] [dande.dev](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGEzHD_yhPK6JCtZkiwFkNilgOe5GmSN7szEcvVfyaVzBEIC58yFuHeRn-7SXOHJ9SOEtfZUIuyEK48qFKl4V3X4aZLmiUi_4fQgveYhXlw41jLuM3P9UvPxjHKAL31Zt5DIPQkfQzoIVx5sLW8819GMtc=)\n[4] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEKRnksjEeHWfGPO8vU_cfafb6rGLl33hIm3VyDfdxv-XdrX7Anb2QF3MqRarWwv7EOD4Yu1GR9-y9eyod8E5BixNkdr7SJ0K0TzCOE-uKjODKbWwGey9q1H6xq2iaJ83RRc9fZzdpIrjsCu01hkH51vmaovfyB8ACP_tJeuQcW8Ga-EoC45nuHZn6VJ7eEtTtpeKnYbdIG-0RAELhdIqWwZwRRBVwXyB_AEQ==)\n[5] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEScamG_mrFojiWdFOV5Ng-BIwAAHLB_1yZdljtaIW519XQz8zkiz6t-Y-JUF9ZYo3kCWRK_kvUx19CWxGaIKlfRPGjR4S48nJo5PcyZxeBNR_RSwN6-MZRoakWvo5RtHKe8UQMCPxh9dRBwzBrSzt6A1nH)\n[6] [kitemetric.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEi0QkqNaxRWu6pZRj-ErI_FbX8BRs-RsMk8hAemv-4geY1VlDTifSIjxunC54sNcV04s3RwGhkgrICeC7E51O4tA6Z8QYGZTlbt3Q26qrWnLTysTSv0Tu3C3QlZrOZ7rTECuQsRN4COZzqnI1r_5Y6drAfEPaJke_nPIJRiiHxstbvM2f75Zztfa_E-JLKkIHRhe4k)\n[7] [stackoverflow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHHVPYr8M8BNUuVrwzs36NG658W5OKwSrmiKh-hyGhBVRH3NgoO1SUr7z3WLl4utzno1e6KUQy6MA-RL-tCPgQf8Vkrid2Rp8IRO7Fg4IbAEM4eHlIkMLU8GB-SuYl13bUyY1BTDhBeNZCz5T-e5-EIFipnRVFgIq-E74427hfNb-hk3puk0oXusgxMmVl8C1D_UajeTsGzEEDvbchsHktiX0sSi827kA==)\n[8] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTHVHLN4FZaXsLxoV4_cMFgU7-McqudGEwLyLnD12DoxvMU5j8tg0-RI1kPP6WENhKDqCynIevEy1LlrmhrQaOQx4AXbL4BAPzld1CNULaCvvWdvYxQd4ezeWjHIcs42z4ByF8sa2T9WBURKHrPNlx4Syza3Wy1mIYqa8VjPiRmmJPXWvq1k8p-dIGrsrsa_uTqVyeQVwd4k8-u_JdNDi8K0Dlt38LLVqM6Q==)\n[9] [digitalapplied.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH5VrEx5NGyuWmxg1kcbHfibc0TpOtcrlrur_I6n2ettH7bNScu_Mz2RSZCP7fQwNqic2om8MBAU8KLH1BRjBofyGiEmQUtxHF6wiZcZQrQLAZ2jGejn6pM5lWY_qiv5aA91vE3xudAejeAoao_YQyw_OYIXa2RksOrxP6TtYxQY2i1EMsfiNBREvAb)\n[10] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGoZIDhCagMQ8tbwHASM0fsOPfYKNJL-Y98StLWey2uruZMiXjC0QV6eXhk8Dhk4hOt42XyAu6ASvGN_u7W-gsfzz7CfD4fJRlsRhkX_-SewYhjzqx5i_l-BDUFYqrXiPem4yiBKN0=)\n[11] [flowbite.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHeDjaF7iRJOCsV0WXz1M7oDLekaM59UjmAgu4qPaUMNdHAfY9fGiZM9_mGNdtWewa32K3OcvZuGzT6D0eFGOOmtA9zuREx7vDC3paJXgAlf5NDveKGnp_NiPVV9U2rkQNSn8dXp3RHk9k=)\n[12] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHoSK7WOCKSCTbHBLtWZwzcAqmT0r3GMna3yMPzYPUtv3DPNNbCq5vGMShXNlKfGkROG4cGcRFKjI0WUY4l1pF9QTJp9ZuLh6e1dyu722UB8fM4WEanerh-JjKV1KzPXi_s4Y9HIzMthKtPZt8wRrV1CQIGVRgNpEA=)\n[13] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF9Dl3dyJoE0Xfdnf9UCg8dU8lBL-9YpOl8QMKIxSpVKTyM0D-3r1RDsmk-GbzPCwX8mQrfFeJYbsZsR6GvR2vdAhxXEtx7hMcfQ_q3HjbuE_xNj059Ts6ODWVR5xAI8YM0)\n[14] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHHQtAdO9ZEvGXUHZo--Eih4T5qxFiQdCWA6xQ7Gq1t1U_p_0WJFxIbVUAmq_frCrEHLGs34GztgghdPlAAyc5I4kqJ5SWdlgLAFB0aCgtNp_xRDuUaJDy1UwniZOS1RXlTj3ZQdsM9NCCVLySAvS1GDZ_dwdDxNCMRGTUZZhIV5qL-OhGM9i4_nhwKqqnMsi0ASEy8X97zKhIHzbQhvs-RNglpq6zxkvqDIV5gP0vhb5Q=)\n[15] [bryananthonio.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG75dyTENoINjinSAKZRZuDRSsAQ1jO_l_2xuqxiPMDHl72ZZg