  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have updated the **Biometric Identity** card in the dashboard settings area to support dark and light theme variations dynamically.\n\n### What was fixed:\n- **Aesthetic Theme Alignment**: Changed the hardcoded dark background (`bg-slate-900 text-white`) of the User Settings card to a dynamic, standard clean slate/white scheme (`bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-150/70 dark:border-slate-800`), matching Cards 1 and 2 in style, border thickness, shadow, and paddings exactly.\n- **Dynamic Text Visibility**: Aligned user metric values, goal description labels, and headers to drop slate values in light mode (`text-slate-800`, `text-slate-850`, `text-emerald-600`) and glowing clean high-contrast tones in dark mode (`dark:text-white`, `dark:text-slate-100`, `dark:text-emerald-400`).\n- **Input and Buttons Balance**: Refactored the \"Reset Biometric Settings\" action button to adopt a soft, clean light gray with subtle borders in light mode, and a muted glass slate in dark mode, maintaining consistency."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
